# Nightly SFTP sweep: DTD timetable + MOTIS reload, DTD fares, NR SMART/TPS
# reference files, and Network Rail Track Model. Runs inside the etl-cron
# Coolify app's container under busybox crond (started as a child process by
# src/server.ts when ETL_CRON=1 — see the Dockerfile). Logs go to stdout so
# Coolify's log viewer shows each run.
0 2 * * * /app/services/etl/cron/run-and-reload-motis.sh >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>> /proc/1/fd/2
